the grab button during play else you might fall down.\n\nPlay in free mode and time challenge mode.\n\n+++ Features +++\n= Gun Hunt Mode\n= Hand Gliding\n= Dual Rope Crossing\n= Zip Lining\n= Elevator Failure\n= Ladder Climbing\n\nExperience city from the top of the sky by doing Hang Gliding, Feel real - Climb the ladder and cross the road with rope, shooting, like a real experience.\n\nExperience the power of virtual reality.\n\n(To enable 120Hz, open the universal menu, go to Settings > Experimental Features, and then enable 120 Hz, Software version 28 required)", "short_description": "Climbing, Flying, Shooting, Falling, Handling and more fun"}]}, "developer_name": "Thunder Game Development Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.thundergamestudio.com/privacy_policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.thundergamestudio.com/privacy_policy.html", "publisher_name": "Thunder Game Development Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.thundergamestudio.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "SHOOTER", "ACTION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US", "en_AU", "en_CA", "en_ZA", "en_GB"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD_VIA_TOUCH", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1135453547233463"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 14, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1442277651439316"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "148569511672